<title>UK: Bryant profit dives in year, holds div.</title>
<headline>Bryant profit dives in year, holds div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to May 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		5.9		    vs 11.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 3.6		    vs same</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 5.05		   vs same</p>
<p> Pretax		     24.6		   vs 45.8</p>
<p> Turnover		   453.6		  vs 489.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Construction company Bryant Group Plc said there was a 16.5 percent fall in home completions in the year. It said operating margins improved in the second half after a sharp drop in consumer confidence at the start of the year.</p>
<p> Operating result	 27.9		   vs 48.7</p>
<p> Interest charge	  4.9		    vs 5.5</p>
<p> Tax			  8.0		    vs 15.1</p>
<p> Net taxed		  16.6		   vs 30.7</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 22</p>
<p> Div registration date  October 8</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 30</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
